WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:03.400
You speak a hundred and fifty words a minute.

00:05.300 --> 00:06.400
You type forty.

00:09.050 --> 00:11.600
Your voice was always the faster interface.

00:13.300 --> 00:15.200
So we built OpenVoiceFlow.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.100
[She holds the fn key and dictates] "Ship the beta tonight — the release notes are already in the doc."

00:22.200 --> 00:23.600
[Transcribing on device — text pastes at the cursor]

00:23.800 --> 00:26.200
On device. Nothing uploaded.

00:27.000 --> 00:28.400
It learns your words.

00:29.350 --> 00:30.600
Matches your tone.

00:31.650 --> 00:33.200
And expands what you say.

00:34.900 --> 00:40.100
Your voice never leaves your Mac. Not encrypted. Not anonymized. Not sent.

00:41.000 --> 00:42.200
No subscription.

00:43.350 --> 00:46.000
Free. Forever. Open source.

00:47.700 --> 00:50.900
OpenVoiceFlow. Speak — and it types.
